    &KIND N
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-PBE-GTH-q5
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q5
    &END KIND
    &KIND Ti
      BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-PBE-GTH-q12
      POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q12
